## Not covered above

`cargo about` reads crate manifests, so these are listed by hand.

- The prebuilt Barretenberg static archive (`libbb-external.a`) that `barretenberg-rs` downloads at
  build time: Apache-2.0, copyright Aztec. Source: the
  [v5.0.0 release](https://github.com/AztecProtocol/barretenberg/releases/tag/v5.0.0), the version
  `barretenberg-rs` 5.0.0 downloads.
- The Rust standard library (`core`, `alloc`, `std` and the crates they bundle), compiled in by
  `build-std`: MIT OR Apache-2.0. See rust-lang/rust's
  [COPYRIGHT](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/master/COPYRIGHT),
  [LICENSE-MIT](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/master/LICENSE-MIT) and
  [LICENSE-APACHE](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/master/LICENSE-APACHE).
- uniffi 0.32.0 and its sibling crates, listed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0 above, are linked
  statically and unmodified. Their source is at
  [crates.io](https://crates.io/crates/uniffi/0.32.0) and [mozilla/uniffi-rs](https://github.com/mozilla/uniffi-rs).
